om 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids each pair from August to September through November to December came in under 90% of normal in 35 years. In 2025 the county&rsquo;s middle value got 36% of normal in January to February and 170% in June to July. So far in 2026, May to June sits at 66% on the middle. Grid 27447 had its driest year in 1989 at 59% of normal.</p>"}
